  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">AUA Avfalls&#xe5;tervinning Armenien 2022-2026</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">AUA Waste management Armenia 2022-2026 - AUA Main phase. Waste management Armenia</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">F&#xf6;rst&#xe4;rkt genomf&#xf6;rande av Armeniens avfallspolicy genom: 1) Framstagande av regelverk f&#xf6;r inf&#xf6;rande av producentansvar, kapacitetsbyggande samt ink&#xf6;p av dataprogram f&#xf6;r hantering av avfallsinformation, samt 2) framtagande av nationell model f&#xf6;r k&#xe4;llsortering (hush&#xe5;llsniv&#xe5;), genomf&#xf6;rande av pilotinsats i en kommun, inklusive kapacitietsbyggande, informationskampanj och utrustning (en sopbil och avfallsk&#xe4;rl).</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Strengthened implementation of Armenia&apos;s waste management policy through 1) Development of legal framework for an Extended Producer Responsibility, capacity building and purchase of data management system IT) and 2) development of a national model for household source separation, implementation of a pilot project on source separation in one Municipality, including capacity building, information and awareness campaign and purchase of one refuse vehicle and waste bins.</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Overall objective: Improved sector capacity to implement environmentally sound waste management policies.

0a: Waste infrastructure investment plans integrated by the national government in the infrastructure programs in other provinces
0b: Waste infrastructure investment plans integrated by the national government in the infrastructure programs in other provinces
0c: Number of settlements with raised capacity for waste sorting at source (separate waste collection coverage in the country)
0d: Number of targeted businesses having intention to invest or expand investment in the WM sector.

Outcome 1: EPR (Extended Producer&apos;s Responsibility) system developed

Outcome 2: National technical guidance for Waste source separation applied in the pilot municipality

Outcome 3: Capacities built for achieving Outcome 1 and Outcome 2, as well as for scaling up the achieved results</narrative>
  </description>
